WEBVTT

00:28:24.246 --> 00:28:30.038
I just sat down at my desk at X and just
wrote an email acknowledging here was

00:28:30.038 --> 00:28:36.371
the vision and here were all the amazing
things that we accomplished.

00:28:36.371 --> 00:28:38.621
But here are the challenges.

00:28:38.996 --> 00:28:42.038
And given where we are now and
everything we've learned,

00:28:42.246 --> 00:28:47.288
I'm inclined to proceed by suggesting
that this doesn't continue.

00:28:47.538 --> 00:28:49.496
Wait, you shut down your own project?

00:28:50.413 --> 00:28:53.413
I did. I recommended that it be shut down.

00:28:53.704 --> 00:28:54.704
Who does that?

00:28:55.121 --> 00:28:58.454
Apparently I do. All it took
was a spreadsheet.

00:28:58.663 --> 00:29:00.329
I just realized the number,